00:02:26.599 --> 00:02:28.711
<v Host>It means for the first time.

00:02:29.312 --> 00:02:39.895
<v Slow>赤ちゃんは4頭で、6月28日の夜から29日の朝にかけて生まれました。

00:02:40.695 --> 00:02:47.271
<v Host>There are four cubs, and they were born from the night of June twenty-eighth into the morning of the twenty-ninth.

00:02:47.872 --> 00:02:50.223
