00:03:05.895 --> 00:03:07.792
<v Vocab>産む

00:03:08.192 --> 00:03:10.135
<v Host>It means to give birth.

00:03:10.735 --> 00:03:19.448
<v Slow>この動物園でチーターの赤ちゃんが生まれたのは、今回が初めてです。

00:03:20.247 --> 00:03:23.872
<v Host>This is the first time cheetah cubs have been born at this zoo.

00:03:24.472 --> 00:03:27.135
