00:03:27.536 --> 00:03:29.024
<v Host>It means a zoo.

00:03:29.623 --> 00:03:37.256
<v Slow>赤ちゃんの体重や、オスかメスかは、まだわかっていません。

00:03:38.056 --> 00:03:43.383
<v Host>The cubs' weight, and whether they are male or female, is not known yet.

00:03:43.984 --> 00:03:46.288
