00:03:46.687 --> 00:03:48.343
<v Host>It means body weight.

00:03:48.943 --> 00:03:57.319
<v Slow>チーターは、走るのが世界でいちばん速い動物として知られています。

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:02.199
<v Host>Cheetahs are known as the fastest running animal in the world.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.984
<v Vocab>速い

00:04:05.383 --> 00:04:07.039
<v Host>It means fast.

00:04:07.639 --> 00:04:15.463
<v Slow>でも、数が減っていて、絶滅が心配される動物です。

00:04:16.264 --> 00:04:20.752
<v Host>But their numbers are falling, and they are an animal in danger of dying out.

00:04:21.351 --> 00:04:23.848
<v Vocab>絶滅

00:04:24.247 --> 00:04:28.303
<v Host>It means extinction, a species dying out completely.

00:04:28.903 --> 00:04:38.072
<v Slow>赤ちゃんはまだ小さいので、しばらくは人に見せないで、大切に育てます。

00:04:38.872 --> 00:04:45.903
<v Host>Because the cubs are still small, they won't be shown to people for a while, and will be raised with great care.

00:04:46.504 --> 00:04:48.951
<v Vocab>育てる

00:04:49.351 --> 00:04:52.016
<v Host>It means to raise or bring up.

