00:06:38.879 --> 00:06:42.911
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:43.512 --> 00:06:49.199
<v Slow>チーターの赤ちゃんは、何頭生まれましたか。

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.800
<v Host>Four cubs were born.

00:06:52.399 --> 00:07:00.295
<v Slow>この動物園でチーターの赤ちゃんが生まれたのは、何回目ですか。

00:07:01.096 --> 00:07:02.776
<v Host>It's the first time.

00:07:03.375 --> 00:07:09.471
<v Slow>チーターは、どんな動物として知られていますか。

00:07:10.271 --> 00:07:13.992
<v Host>It's known as the fastest running animal in the world.

00:07:14.591 --> 00:07:32.687
<v Host>That's all for today. A cheetah named Lucy gave birth to four cubs at a zoo in Hiroshima, the first cheetah birth ever there. The cubs are staying with their mother and won't be shown to the public for a while. Let's hope they grow up healthy. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:07:33.288 --> 00:07:35.687
<v News>また明日。
